{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Show info of an otter managed container    {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter info    [options] [container]{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter inspect [options] [container]{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter info my-box{R}                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter info my-box --root{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter inspect my-box{R}                       {2}│{R}
